# Halo — Lucifer light theme
#
# A conventional light theme: white surfaces, neutral greys for chrome
# and lines, soft near-black text, and one blue accent. (Plan 9's own
# colours are glenda.)

# Core UI
bg FFFFFF
border D6D6D6
windowborder C4C4C4
header F0F0F0
accent 2266CC
text 2B2B2B
text2 5C5C5C
dim 8C8C8C
label BDBDBD

# Conversation zone
human E8F0FC
veltro F4F4F4
input FFFFFF
cursor 2266CC

# Status / semantic
red C0392B
green 2E7D32
yellow B07A12
progbg E6E6E6
progfg 2266CC

# Code blocks
codebg F5F6F8

# Context menu
menubg FFFFFF
menuborder C8C8C8
menuhilit E1EBFA
menutext 2B2B2B
menudim 9A9A9A

# Editor
